{
  "_comment": [
    "Which first-party library public-header trees the C ABI Doxygen reference covers.",
    "ADR-0005 puts that reference at /api/c/ of the docs hub. Doxyfile.capi carries no",
    "INPUT of its own: scripts/builders/docs_capi.sh feeds it the roots emitted from this",
    "file, so this manifest is the single place the covered surface is declared.",
    "scripts/checks/check_c_abi_doc_headers.py fails when a library with public headers",
    "under libs/<lib>/inc/ is in neither list, so a new library cannot silently miss the",
    "API reference, and fails on stale or unexplained entries in either list."
  ],
  "header_glob": "libs/<lib>/inc/**/*.h",
  "output_slot": "api/c",
